#: ../../source/docs/building-setup-mac.rst:5 0f9dce8d5df24766bf13239c07c06df8
msgid "Setting up the Build Environment (MacOSX)"
msgstr "搭建构建环境（MacOSX）"

#: ../../source/docs/building-setup-mac.rst:7 bba74586893d47489d934e40f4e41d7b
msgid ""
"This article shows how to manually setup a minimal build environment on "
"MacOS (ver 10.6 onwards)."
msgstr "本文介绍如何在 MacOS（10.6 及以上版本）上手动搭建最小化构建环境。"

#: ../../source/docs/building-setup-mac.rst:13 37f6d3e029bd4cf589b0f5be3c049b9b
msgid ""
"There is a `pre-built script  "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/blob/master/Tools/environment_install"
"/install-prereqs-mac.sh>`__ that will install these pre-requisites."
msgstr ""
"提供了一个 `预构建脚本 "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/blob/master/Tools/environment_install"
"/install-prereqs-mac.sh>`__，可自动安装这些前提条件。"

