#: ../../source/docs/building-setup-mac.rst:25 267a188ea2494adcb6983da3d87318c2
msgid ""
"MacOS will alert you when you enter a command in the terminal that "
"requires Xcode Command Line Tools. You can also install Xcode Command "
"Line Tools manually"
msgstr ""
"在终端中输入需要 Xcode Command Line Tools 的命令时，MacOS 会弹出提示。你也可以手动安装 Xcode Command"
" Line Tools。"

#: ../../source/docs/building-setup-mac.rst:31 7037f2082ef94dd78a725eb07b156f0b
msgid ""
"Install `Homebrew <http://brew.sh>`__ for MacOS (Homebrew is a respected "
