msgid "Cleaning"
msgstr "清理"

#: ../../source/docs/building-setup-mac.rst:85 7ca1a395bad64643a0b62ca26b840b84
msgid ""
"If there have been updates to some git submodules you may need to do a "
"full clean build. To do that use:"
msgstr "如果某些 git 子模块有更新，可能需要进行完整的清理构建，使用以下命令："

#: ../../source/docs/building-setup-mac.rst:91 8512b37eb8b44e1285a0f4b16d23d2ae
msgid ""
"Commands `clean` and `distclean` can be used to clean the objects "
"produced by the build. `clean` keeps the configure information, cleaning "
"only the objects for the current board. `distclean` cleans everything for"
" every board, including the saved configure information."
msgstr ""
"`clean` 和 `distclean` 命令可用于清理构建产物。`clean` 保留配置信息，仅清理当前板的构建产物。`distclean` "
"清理所有板的所有内容，包括已保存的配置信息。"

